{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqsf07wpwcj","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Agentic search context delivery clip fixed via fuller content field","summary":"Root cause of the our-way-prod arm answering \"I don't know\" on LongMemEval Oracle even when the grader keeps the right chunk: the context delivered to the answerer was clipped to the 200-char display summary BEFORE reaching context_deps. In lib/search/memory-search.js result.summary is set via slice(0,200); in lib/subconscious/index.js rankResults runs every result through compactResult (which drops all unlisted fields and reclips to 240); contextDependencyFromResult then emits summary.slice(0,240), a no-op. Source chunks (lib/note-source-cluster.js CHUNK_CHARS=1200) hold the full answer-bearing text in node.summary, so 200 chars truncated the answer. Fix (token-aware, agentic-path only): searchUrlForPlan sets full_content=1 (only the subconscious agentic paths build that URL; one-shot GET /search never sets it). compileSearchContext on that flag attaches a bounded content field (<=1200) from the live node text, leaving the 200-char display summary untouched. compactResult preserves content; contextDependencyFromResult emits content as the delivered summary when present, else the prior 240 clip. Verified by direct HTTP repro against the worktree daemon (commit 00806352): POST /subconscious/search-context returned context_deps with summary_len=1200 and the GPS answer text present, while GET /search stayed at 200 with no content field. Two Windows harness gotchas: (1) zonoid_bench _find_daemon_js prefers a daemon.js whose sibling node_modules/@xenova exists, so a git worktree without node_modules falls back to the MAIN repo daemon.js; create a node_modules directory junction in the worktree to the main node_modules so the worktree daemon.js wins. (2) The bench embedded daemon exits code=1 mid-run and the eager-judge runs idle (smoke A2 idle=True, candidates=[]), so context_deps=[] and the answerer gets nothing — a pre-existing environment instability that blocks the full our-way-prod bench on this box, independent of the delivery fix (smoke RAG-control still scored F1","category":null,"tags":[],"created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-24T18:36:48.265Z","vec":[-0.07792899757623672,0.04641534760594368,-0.025359464809298515,0.016107620671391487,0.04663541913032532,-0.04777788370847702,-0.03245824575424194,0.059973325580358505,0.0299085546284914,0.024477096274495125,0.03226093202829361,-0.03007708489894867,0.05662946403026581,-0.06255504488945007,-0.01671788841485977,-0.006928890012204647,0.07930594682693481,0.039503712207078934,-0.039221178740262985,-0.031677935272455215,0.05528797581791878,0.042796142399311066,0.03990345448255539,-0.02465364895761013,0.02295893430709839,0.019661640748381615,-0.13615286350250244,-0.06741970032453537,0.0011099462863057852,-0.013515069149434566,0.050997618585824966,0.08897506445646286,0.007484603673219681,0.04460303112864494,-0.013564382679760456,0.08895900100469589,-0.021322932094335556,-0.03677026554942131,-0.045881424099206924,-0.048392146825790405,0.028542514890432358,0.13498398661613464,-0.07045503705739975,0.036708083003759384,-0.02749631367623806,-0.04554549604654312,-0.10639511048793793,-0.050074100494384766,0.002331256167963147,-0.07695544511079788,-0.1201501414179802,0.051771268248558044,-0.037291042506694794,0.05070704594254494,0.025240082293748856,0.027241064235568047,-0.023320456966757774,0.06577737629413605,-0.03310359641909599,-0.010549092665314674,-0.008995824493467808,-0.04892240837216377,-0.016355816274881363,-0.07412859052419662,0.06533090025186539,-0.011781110428273678,0.039352092891931534,-0.06499859690666199,0.008890488184988499,-0.04865555092692375,0.024541642516851425,0.024990977719426155,-0.05651462823152542,0.00765714468434453,-0.042733531445264816,0.09249988943338394,0.015417401678860188,0.020083101466298103,-0.006596515886485577,-0.08617459982633591,-0.000735881389118731,-0.0309128575026989,0.03244347125291824,0.